<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:19:21 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Palantir 首席执行官亚历克斯·卡普 (Alex Karp) 庆祝收入增长 93%，股价在巨额盈利后飙升：“人们第一次相信我们”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/palantir-ceo-alex-karp-celebrates-93-revenue-growth-as-stock-soars-after-blockbuster-earnings-for-the-first-time-people-believe-us/</link><description>Palantir 的人工智能软件业务季度业绩表现强劲，收入飙升 93%，盘后股价上涨 14%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2284902256-e1785797099965.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:04:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/palantir-ceo-alex-karp-celebrates-93-revenue-growth-as-stock-soars-after-blockbuster-earnings-for-the-first-time-people-believe-us/</guid></item><item><title>电动空中出租车终于准备起飞</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/electric-air-taxis-joby-aviation-evtols-archer-aviation/</link><description>由于一项联邦计划，一种新型飞机——半直升机、半无人机——今年夏天开始在美国各地进行实际测试。首先是货物，紧随其后的是乘客。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2273030950-e1785170440409.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/electric-air-taxis-joby-aviation-evtols-archer-aviation/</guid></item><item><title>Sea 的 MariBank 希望出口其新加坡数字银行业务：第一站是菲律宾</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/sea-maribank-singapore-philippines-digital-bank/</link><description>MariBank 于 2023 年成立，是东南亚最大的科技公司 Sea 的全资子公司，在《财富》东南亚 500 强企业中排名第 12。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Natalia-Goh_Profile.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/sea-maribank-singapore-philippines-digital-bank/</guid></item><item><title>“隐藏的宝石”：奥德赛粉丝在 eBay 上花费高达 2,000 美元购买 70 毫米 IMAX 门票</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/the-odyssey-fans-shelling-out-buy-70mm-imax-tickets-ebay/</link><description>这个票房成功故事激发了创纪录的影院上座率，并表明好莱坞使用的模拟方法有所增加。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286137358.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:59:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/the-odyssey-fans-shelling-out-buy-70mm-imax-tickets-ebay/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国人工智能需求使收入飙升超过目标，Palantir 股价上涨 13%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/palantir-earnings-guidance-beat-revenue-profit-ai-demand/</link><description>随着美国商业销售额攀升 149%，收入同比飙升 93%，促使 Palantir 将其全年展望上调至高于华尔街预期。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287890087-e1785789872221.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 20:57:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/palantir-earnings-guidance-beat-revenue-profit-ai-demand/</guid></item><item><title>来吧，取笑汤米·巴哈马。首席执行官很高兴加入您，但他可能不喜欢您的学院风短裤</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/tommy-bahama-ceo-doug-wood-on-clothing-fashion-having-fun/</link><description>道格·伍德是一个可爱的角色。他对于应该穿什么以及如何在穿着时获得乐趣的想法值得争论。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Doug-Wood-Tommy-Bahama-CEO-1-e1785767784395.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:47:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/tommy-bahama-ceo-doug-wood-on-clothing-fashion-having-fun/</guid></item><item><title>独家：OpenAI 前高管 Fidji Simo 讨论了她与 POTS 的斗争，以及她的初创公司计划用 AI 和 3,500 瓶血液来治愈它（到目前为止）</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/fidji-simo-discusses-pots-diseases-chroniclebio-ai-startup-openai/</link><description>Simo 是 ChronicleBio 的联合创始人，该公司旨在通过使用最新的人工智能模型分析生物数据来治疗复杂的慢性疾病。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2198337502-e1785775761210.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:23:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/fidji-simo-discusses-pots-diseases-chroniclebio-ai-startup-openai/</guid></item><item><title>基础经济学揭示了为什么马姆达尼在纽约的社会主义杂货店注定会失败</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/mamdani-city-owned-supermarkets-laws-of-economics/</link><description>市长耗资 7000 万美元的超市让这座城市与一种很少失败的力量展开竞争：市场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287861112.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/mamdani-city-owned-supermarkets-laws-of-economics/</guid></item><item><title>《财富》世界 500 强排名第一：亚马逊的杰夫·贝佐斯讲述他的车库初创公司如何成为全球收入最大的公司</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/28/amazon-jeff-bezos-andy-jassy-ecommerce-ai-big-tech-global-500/</link><description>亚马逊今年向人工智能领域投入了 2000 亿美元，贝佐斯表示，该公司的下一步行动将定义下一个十年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Jeff-Bezos-social-thumbnail.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/28/amazon-jeff-bezos-andy-jassy-ecommerce-ai-big-tech-global-500/</guid></item><item><title>美联储主席凯文·沃什谈论了一场大戏，但这个市场指标将告诉你在他造成“信誉冲击”后华尔街是否信任他</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/fed-chair-kevin-warsh-credibility-shock-rate-hikes-inflation-yield-curve/</link><description>“最重要的是，美联储可信度的一个重要部分不仅仅是说它有某些目标，而且还在于解释它将如何实现这些目标。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287530714-e1785610051560.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:27:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/fed-chair-kevin-warsh-credibility-shock-rate-hikes-inflation-yield-curve/</guid></item></channel></rss>